{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"可分闭包"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"可分闭包"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"域","text":"域"}},{"Plain":" $F$ 的可分闭包是满足如下条件的"},{"Local":{"url":"域扩张","text":"域扩张"}},{"Plain":" $F \\hookrightarrow F_S$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$F \\hookrightarrow F_S$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"可分扩张","text":"可分扩张"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$F_S$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"可分闭域","text":"可分闭域"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p>取定 $F$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"代数闭包","text":"代数闭包"}},{"Plain":" $\\overline{F}$, 那么 $F$ 的可分闭包也可定义为 $\\overline{F}$ 中在 $F$ 上可分的元素构成的子域.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>可分闭包是正规的, 从而是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Galois扩张","text":"Galois 扩张"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>域的可分闭包在同构意义下唯一, 但可能有非平凡的自同构.</p>\n"}]}}